"在主歌词下方增加一行。译文和读音对应当前句，「下一句」显示即将演唱的歌词，选择后展开区不再重复显示下一句预览。空间不足时歌词行自动增高" = "Adds a line under the main lyric. Translation and Romanization match the current line; Next Line shows the upcoming one, and the expanded area then no longer repeats the next-line preview. The lyric row grows when space runs short";
"在主歌词下方增加一行，高度不变（两行分别为 10pt / 9pt，「字号」不生效）。译文和读音对应当前句，「下一句」显示即将演唱的歌词；开启副行时，主行不再提前切换到下一句。副行不滚动，空间不足时末尾渐隐" = "Adds a second line under the lyric without changing the item’s height (10pt / 9pt; Font Size has no effect). Translation and Romanization show the current line; Next Line shows the upcoming one. With a second line on, the main line no longer switches early. The second line doesn’t scroll; its end fades out when it doesn’t fit";
"在主行下方增加一行：译文和读音对应当前句，「下一句」为即将演唱的歌词。开启后两行字号固定为 14pt / 11pt，「字号」不生效，主行也不再提前切换到下一句；副行空间不足时，按该句时长横向滚动" = "Adds a second line under the main line: Translation and Romanization follow the current line, and Next Line shows the upcoming one. With it on, the two lines are fixed at 14pt / 11pt (Font Size has no effect) and the main line no longer switches early. A second line that doesn't fit scrolls across over the line's duration";
